  "short_description": "FortiOS, FortiPAM, FortiProxy and FortiSwitchManager contain a path-traversal vulnerability (CVE-2025-61624, CWE-22) in the command line interpreter: an authenticated attacker with an admin profile and at least read-write permissions can write or delete arbitrary files via specifically crafted arguments to existing commands, escalating privileges on the device. Fortinet and CISA both confirm exploitation in the wild.",
